  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ability to create stable objects allows you to share them freely.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ability to use the genesis etherheart, caster level 8th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your genesis manifestations with a range of personal now have a range of close (25 ft. + 5ft./2 levels). This allows you to pass out certain products of your ethermagic without them vanishing into thin air, as well as not totally losing that product if it is dropped or disarmed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
